y 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (focused phone field with keypad, primary account, sheet and side-menu presentation)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"5:83\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 4 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"3ebbf227-312d-44d8-a0ff-fe4c39f2e43e"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__get_metadata_2_695ba8bd","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
